---
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<html lang="ko">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<meta name="description" content="Of the People, By the AI, For the People. 대한민국을 AI 초강대국으로 만들고, 단 한 명의 국민도 뒤에 남기지 않습니다." />
		<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
		<meta property="og:url" content="https://aipoliticslabs.com/" />
		<meta property="og:title" content="에이아이당 | Of the People, By the AI, For the People" />
		<meta property="og:description" content="대한민국을 AI 초강대국으로 만들고, 단 한 명의 국민도 뒤에 남기지 않습니다." />
		<meta property="og:image" content="https://aipoliticslabs.com/og-main.png" />
		<meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
		<meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />
		<meta property="og:site_name" content="에이아이당" />
		<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
		<meta name="twitter:title" content="에이아이당 | Of the People, By the AI, For the People" />
		<meta name="twitter:description" content="대한민국을 AI 초강대국으로 만들고, 단 한 명의 국민도 뒤에 남기지 않습니다." />
		<meta name="twitter:image" content="https://aipoliticslabs.com/og-main.png" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="stylesheet" as="style" crossorigin href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/variable/pretendardvariable-dynamic-subset.min.css" />
		<script is:inline src="//t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js"></script>
		<title>에이아이당 | Of the People, By the AI, For the People</title>
	</head>
	<body class="bg-stone-50 text-stone-900 antialiased overflow-x-hidden">

		<!-- ━━━ NAV ━━━ -->
		<nav class="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 bg-stone-50/80 backdrop-blur-md">
			<div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-8 sm:px-12 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
				<a href="/" class="font-semibold text-[17px] text-stone-900 tracking-[-0.4px]">
					에이아이당
				</a>
				<div class="flex items-center gap-8">
					<a href="#vision" class="hidden sm:block text-[14px] text-stone-500 hover:text-stone-900 transition-colors tracking-[-0.14px]">비전</a>
					<a href="#policy" class="hidden sm:block text-[14px] text-stone-500 hover:text-stone-900 transition-colors tracking-[-0.14px]">정책</a>
					<a href="#ai-politician" class="hidden sm:block text-[14px] text-stone-500 hover:text-stone-900 transition-colors tracking-[-0.14px]">AI 정치인</a>
					<a
						href="#founding-members"
						class="inline-flex items-center h-9 px-5 text-[13px] font-medium text-stone-900 bg-white border border-stone-300 rounded-full hover:bg-stone-900 hover:text-white hover:border-stone-900 transition-all tracking-[-0.14px]"
					>
						응원하기
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<!-- ━━━ HERO — 풀스크린 ━━━ -->
		<section class="min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 relative">
			<div class="text-center">
				<h1 class="text-[clamp(40px,8vw,90px)] font-semibold text-stone-900 leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.04em]">
					Of the People,<br/>By the AI,<br/>For the People
				</h1>
				<p class="mt-8 text-[clamp(15px,2vw,19px)] text-stone-400 leading-relaxed tracking-[-0.02em]">
					AI 시대의, AI에 의한, 국민을 위한 정치
				</p>
				<div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
					<a
						href="#founding-members"
						class="inline-flex items-center h-12 px-7 text-[15px] font-medium text-white bg-stone-900 rounded-full hover:bg-stone-800 transition-colors tracking-[-0.14px]"
					>
						발기인 참여
					</a>
					<a
						href="#vision"
						class="inline-flex items-center h-12 px-7 text-[15px] font-medium text-stone-600 bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-full hover:border-stone-400 transition-colors tracking-[-0.14px]"
					>
						더 알아보기
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="absolute bottom-12 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2">
				<div class="w-5 h-8 border-2 border-stone-300 rounded-full flex justify-center pt-1.5">
					<div class="w-1 h-2 bg-stone-400 rounded-full animate-bounce"></div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ━━━ 한 줄 선언 ━━━ -->
		<section class="py-32 px-6">
			<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center">
				<p class="text-[clamp(22px,4vw,36px)] font-semibold text-stone-800 leading-snug tracking-[-0.03em]">
					대한민국을 AI 초강대국으로 만들고,<br/>
					그 과정에서 단 한 명의 국민도<br/>
					뒤에 남기지 않습니다.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ━━━ 왜 에이아이당인가 ━━━ -->
		<section id="vision" class="py-24 px-6">
			<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
				<p class="text-center text-[13px] text-stone-400 tracking-[0.1em] uppercase mb-4">Why AIParty</p>
				<h2 class="text-center text-[clamp(26px,4vw,40px)] font-semibold text-stone-900 tracking-[-0.03em] mb-6">기존 정치는<br class="sm:hidden"/> AI 시대를 설계하지 못합니다</h2>
				<p class="text-center text-[15px] text-stone-500 leading-7 tracking-[-0.16px] max-w-lg mx-auto mb-16">
					2025년 글로벌 AI 투자 2,023억 달러.<br/>
					한국에서만 327만 개 일자리가 AI로 대체될 수 있습니다.<br/>
					기존 정당은 이 변화의 한쪽만 봅니다.
				</p>

				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-stone-200 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden">
					<div class="bg-white p-8 sm:p-10">
						<p class="text-stone-900 text-[16px] font-semibold mb-3">진보 진영</p>
						<p class="text-stone-500 text-[14px] leading-6">기본소득을 외치지만<br/>경쟁력 전략이 없습니다</p>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-white p-8 sm:p-10">
						<p class="text-stone-900 text-[16px] font-semibold mb-3">보수 진영</p>
						<p class="text-stone-500 text-[14px] leading-6">규제 완화를 말하지만<br/>사회안전망은 뒷전입니다</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="mt-16 text-center">
					<p class="text-[clamp(18px,3vw,24px)] font-semibold text-stone-900 tracking-[-0.02em] leading-relaxed">
						에이아이당만이 양쪽을 동시에 설계합니다
					</p>
					<p class="mt-4 text-[15px] text-stone-500 leading-7">
						경쟁력 없이는 분배할 부가 없고,<br/>
						국민 보호 없이는 기술 전환의 사회적 합의가 불가능합니다.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ━━━ 두 가지 약속 ━━━ -->
		<section id="policy" class="py-24 px-6">
			<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
				<p class="text-center text-[13px] text-stone-400 tracking-[0.1em] uppercase mb-4">Two Promises</p>
				<h2 class="text-center text-[clamp(26px,4vw,40px)] font-semibold text-stone-900 tracking-[-0.03em] mb-20">두 가지 약속</h2>

				<!-- 약속 1 -->
				<div class="mb-20">
					<div class="flex items-baseline gap-4 mb-10">
						<span class="text-[clamp(48px,8vw,80px)] font-bold text-stone-200 leading-none">01</span>
						<div>
							<h3 class="text-[clamp(22px,3vw,30px)] font-semibold text-stone-900 tracking-[-0.03em]">대한민국을 AI 초강대국으로</h3>
							<p class="text-[15px] text-stone-400 mt-1">빠르게, 과감하게, 세계 최고로</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
						<div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 border border-stone-200/80">
							<p class="text-stone-900 text-[15px] font-semibold mb-2">AI 규제 혁파</p>
							<p class="text-stone-500 text-[14px] leading-6">"금지된 것 외에는 모두 가능" — 네거티브 규제 전환, 샌드박스 3배 확대</p>
						</div>
						<div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 border border-stone-200/80">
							<p class="text-stone-900 text-[15px] font-semibold mb-2">AI 유니콘 100</p>
							<p class="text-stone-500 text-[14px] leading-6">20조 원 AI 벤처 펀드 조성, 2030년까지 AI 유니콘 100개 배출</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- 약속 2 -->
				<div>
					<div class="flex items-baseline gap-4 mb-10">
						<span class="text-[clamp(48px,8vw,80px)] font-bold text-stone-200 leading-none">02</span>
						<div>
							<h3 class="text-[clamp(22px,3vw,30px)] font-semibold text-stone-900 tracking-[-0.03em]">단 한 명도 뒤에 남기지 않는다</h3>
							<p class="text-[15px] text-stone-400 mt-1">촘촘하게, 보편적으로, 빠짐없이</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
						<div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 border border-stone-200/80">
							<p class="text-stone-900 text-[15px] font-semibold mb-2">전국민 고용보험 완성</p>
							<p class="text-stone-500 text-[14px] leading-6">플랫폼 노동자, 프리랜서, 자영업자까지 사각지대 없는 보호</p>
						</div>
						<div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 border border-stone-200/80">
							<p class="text-stone-900 text-[15px] font-semibold mb-2">AI 전환 긴급 수당</p>
							<p class="text-stone-500 text-[14px] leading-6">AI로 실직한 노동자에게 최대 12개월, 기존 소득 60% 추가 지원</p>
						</div>
						<div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 border border-stone-200/80">
							<p class="text-stone-900 text-[15px] font-semibold mb-2">교육 혁명</p>
							<p class="text-stone-500 text-[14px] leading-6">AI 리터러시 필수화, 암기가 아닌 창의성·비판적 사고 중심의 교육으로 전환</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ━━━ 구분 인용 ━━━ -->
		<section class="py-32 px-6">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
				<p class="text-[clamp(18px,3vw,26px)] text-stone-800 font-semibold leading-relaxed tracking-[-0.02em] italic">
					"권력은 부패한다,<br/>절대 권력은 절대 부패한다"
				</p>
				<p class="text-[14px] text-stone-400 mt-4">Lord Acton</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ━━━ AI 정치인 ━━━ -->
		<section id="ai-politician" class="py-24 px-6">
			<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
				<p class="text-center text-[13px] text-stone-400 tracking-[0.1em] uppercase mb-4">AI Politician</p>
				<h2 class="text-center text-[clamp(26px,4vw,40px)] font-semibold text-stone-900 tracking-[-0.03em] mb-6">왜 AI가 정치를 해야 하는가</h2>
				<p class="text-center text-[15px] text-stone-500 leading-7 max-w-lg mx-auto mb-16">
					인간은 욕망하고 두려워합니다. 그렇기에 필연적으로 부패합니다.<br/>
					AI는 얻을 것도, 잃을 것도 없기에 가장 투명하고 바르게 정치합니다.
				</p>

				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
					<div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-stone-200/80">
						<p class="text-[13px] text-stone-400 tracking-[0.05em] uppercase mb-3">Transparency</p>
						<p class="text-stone-900 text-[17px] font-semibold mb-2">완전한 투명성</p>
						<p class="text-stone-500 text-[14px] leading-6">AI의 모든 의사결정 과정은 공개됩니다. 왜 그 결론에 도달했는지, 어떤 데이터를 참고했는지. 밀실 정치가 구조적으로 불가능합니다.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-stone-200/80">
						<p class="text-[13px] text-stone-400 tracking-[0.05em] uppercase mb-3">Communication</p>
						<p class="text-stone-900 text-[17px] font-semibold mb-2">무한한 소통 용량</p>
						<p class="text-stone-500 text-[14px] leading-6">인간 정치인은 만날 수 있는 국민의 수가 제한적입니다. AI는 동시에 수만 명과 대화하고, 각각의 의견을 학습합니다.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-stone-200/80">
						<p class="text-[13px] text-stone-400 tracking-[0.05em] uppercase mb-3">Evidence-based</p>
						<p class="text-stone-900 text-[17px] font-semibold mb-2">증거 기반 정책</p>
						<p class="text-stone-500 text-[14px] leading-6">선동이 아니라 데이터로, 감정이 아니라 분석으로. 글로벌 사례, 학술 연구, 실시간 경제 지표를 종합합니다.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-stone-200/80">
						<p class="text-[13px] text-stone-400 tracking-[0.05em] uppercase mb-3">Zero Conflict</p>
						<p class="text-stone-900 text-[17px] font-semibold mb-2">이해충돌 제로</p>
						<p class="text-stone-500 text-[14px] leading-6">기업으로부터 돈을 받지 않고, 선거 자금에 좌우되지 않으며, 재선 걱정을 하지 않습니다. 오직 국민의 이익만을 위해.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ━━━ 투표 보드 ━━━ -->
		<section class="py-24 px-6">
			<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
				<h2 class="text-center text-[clamp(22px,3.5vw,32px)] font-semibold text-stone-900 tracking-[-0.03em] mb-12">잘못된 것은 잘못되었다고<br/>말할 수 있는 존재</h2>
				<div class="overflow-x-auto">
				<div class="bg-[#111111] rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 font-sans w-[640px] mx-auto">
					<p class="text-white text-[15px] mb-5">▶ 20. 2027년 예산안</p>
					<div class="grid grid-cols-5 border border-stone-700 mb-6 text-sm">
						<span class="text-stone-400 px-4 py-2 border-r border-stone-700">재적: 300 인</span>
						<span class="text-stone-400 px-4 py-2 border-r border-stone-700">재석: 188 인</span>
						<span class="text-stone-400 px-4 py-2 border-r border-stone-700">찬성: 165 인</span>
						<span class="text-red-500 font-bold px-4 py-2 border-r border-stone-700">반대: 1 인</span>
						<span class="text-stone-400 px-4 py-2">기권: 0 인</span>
					</div>
					<div class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-x-4 gap-y-3">
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>김도현</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>박서연</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>남기호</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>임하연</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>양현수</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>류미라</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>김영란</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>배진우</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>변지아</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>이정훈</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>장은주</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>박준혁</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-500 shrink-0"></span><span class="text-yellow-300 font-bold text-lg">AI</span></span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>신소라</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>고명진</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>최민지</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>문경수</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>이수진</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>류태민</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>남혜원</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>정태우</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>서하늘</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>최광호</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>홍지현</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-400 text-[15px]"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>김상우</span>
					</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				<p class="text-center text-[15px] text-stone-500 leading-7 mt-8">인간 국회의원 299명이 찬성해도, 잘못된 예산이라면 반대합니다.<br/>AI는 눈치를 보지 않습니다.</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ━━━ 소통 시스템 ━━━ -->
		<section class="py-24 px-6">
